In article <1991Jun4.091901.26485@informatik.uni-erlangen.de> kssingvo@immd4.informatik.uni-erlangen.de (Klaus Singvogel) writes:
>user_442@dayton.saic.com writes:
>But I believe: a blessed luck stone is the best item you can wish.

There is no _best_ item to wish for; it depends entirely on your circumstances
at the time you get a wish.

 (POSSIBLE SPOILERS)

The last few games I've made it to the castle level, I have wished for
a blessed +2 helm of opposite alignment with the wand as I've been playing
healers and samuri lately.  Also, I wish for a blessed ring of levitation
about half the time I get to the castle.

Instead of a ring of teleport control and cursed teleportation scrolls, I
prefer to wish for cursed magic markers and cursed scrolls of genocide (if
I haven't already found them)..  This way, I can reverse genocide tengus
at will, get the two important intrinsics, write a cursed scroll of
teleportation, and bless the magic marker.  One suggestion: it might be a
good idea to reverse genocide tengus on the castle level so you can't
teleport while trying to get the controlled intrinsic.

Of course, there are always the two favorites:

blessed +2 pair of speed boots
blessed +2 gray dragon scale mail

which if you don't already have are superior to other items under most
circumstances.
